==Description==
'''Sad Scout''' is a sticker that can be purchased in the store for {{Coins|200}}.

==Appearance==
The sticker showcases a shocked Default Level 0 [[Scout]] crying.

==Trivia==
*'''Sad Scout's''' image can be seen in-game when attempting to gift a product while being the only player in the server.
*The sound that plays when using the '''Sad Scout''' sticker originates from ''Undertale''.
*'''Sad Scout''' was given out as a physical sticker by the developers during the Roblox Developer Conference 2025.

